<title>POLAND: Beton Stal Q2 net rises to PLN 2.2 mln.</title>
<headline>Beton Stal Q2 net rises to PLN 2.2 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Beton Stal preliminary results for the second quarter of the year ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q2 1997	Q2 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			 3.62 vs	0.21</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   3.53 vs	0.18</p>
<p>    net profit				 2.20 vs	0.15</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Beton Stal SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				 21.47 vs	4.45</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  17.85 vs	3.46</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		   0.00 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    income tax				 1.33 vs	0.03</p>
<p>    other taxes				  na vs	  na</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     0.41 vs	0.01</p>
<p>    financial costs			  0.50 vs	0.04</p>
<p>    investment				21.72 vs	0.25</p>
<p>						H1 1997	H1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			 3.88 vs	0.02 loss</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   3.69 vs	0.04</p>
<p>    net profit				 2.30 vs	0.01</p>
<p>    net sales				 29.84 vs	6.35</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  25.94 vs	5.06</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		   0.00 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    income tax				 1.39 vs	0.03</p>
<p>    other taxes				  na vs	  na</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     0.59 vs	0.48</p>
<p>    financial costs			  0.77 vs	0.42</p>
<p>    investment				23.16 vs	0.52</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
